# How to Integrate Wazuh with n8n for SIEM System

---

## Overview

This project focuses on building a SIEM system using Wazuh.  
The system is integrated with n8n to automate alert processing and send notifications in real-time.  

The purpose of this project is to enhance security monitoring and reduce manual analysis by automating security workflows.

---

## Goals

- Detect threats in real-time
- Automate alert processing
- Integrate VirusTotal for malware analysis
- Send notifications to Discord

---

## Architecture

```text
Wazuh Agent
     ↓
Wazuh Manager
     ↓
Wazuh API
     ↓
n8n Workflow
     ↓
Discord Webhook
```

---

