## Workflow Explanation

The Wazuh agent collects logs and security events from monitored endpoints.  
These events are forwarded to the Wazuh Manager for analysis and rule matching.  

When an alert is triggered, the Wazuh API sends alert data to the n8n workflow using HTTP requests.  
n8n processes the alert, enriches the data with VirusTotal analysis, and formats the notification using JavaScript nodes.  

Finally, the processed alert is sent automatically to Discord through webhook or direct message nodes for real-time monitoring and incident response.

